  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Migration Governance and Access to Services for Displaced Afghans in Pakistan and Central Asia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this intervention, IOM seeks to support government institutions and communities in Kazakhstan, Pakistan, Tajikistan, Turkmenistan, and Uzbekistan. In particular, IOM will address needs of Afghan nationals and local communities, mitigate the mid-term impact of the Afghanistan crisis on societies in the region, and support recovery and resilience for longer term sustainable development.</narrative>
  </description>
